{
	"rules": {
		"title": "Pyramid",
		"description": "Solitaire. Clear the pyramid by pairing two uncovered cards that add up to 13: drag one onto the other. Kings are 13 on their own: click them. Queens are 12, Jacks 11, Aces 1. Click the stock to turn a card onto the waste; you can go through the stock three times.",
		"how_to_play": [
			"# Goal",
			"Clear the whole pyramid by removing pairs of cards that add up to 13.",
			"# How",
			"- Only uncovered cards (with nothing overlapping them) can be used.",
			"- Drag one uncovered card onto another (or onto the waste's top card) when the two add up to 13. Aces are 1, Jacks 11, Queens 12.",
			"- Kings are 13 on their own: click one to remove it.",
			"- Click the stock to turn a card onto the waste. You can go through the stock three times."
		],
